{"seq":1,"slug":"color-spaces-gamut","title":"色彩空间与色域","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-science/color-management/color-spaces-gamut","wordCount":1317,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"色彩空间与色域\">色彩空间与色域</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>色彩空间（Color Space）是色彩模型在特定技术条件下的具体实现——它定义了三原色的精确光谱位置、白点坐标和传输函数。色域（Gamut）则是一个色彩空间能表示的全部颜色范围。选择正确的色彩空间，本质上是在&quot;信息容量&quot;和&quot;设备兼容性&quot;之间做权衡。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;Color Spaces&lt;br/&gt;色彩空间&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Standard Gamut&lt;br/&gt;标准色域&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;Wide Gamut&lt;br/&gt;宽色域&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;Ultra-Wide Gamut&lt;br/&gt;超宽色域&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;sRGB&lt;br/&gt;网络/SDR标准&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;DCI-P3&lt;br/&gt;电影/Apple&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[&quot;Adobe RGB&lt;br/&gt;印刷&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;Rec.2020&lt;br/&gt;HDR广播&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[&quot;ProPhoto RGB&lt;br/&gt;编辑空间&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[&quot;ACEScg&lt;br/&gt;VFX&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"Color Spaces&lt;br/&gt;色彩空间\"] --&gt; B[\"Standard Gamut&lt;br/&gt;标准色域\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"Wide Gamut&lt;br/&gt;宽色域\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"Ultra-Wide Gamut&lt;br/&gt;超宽色域\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"sRGB&lt;br/&gt;网络/SDR标准\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"DCI-P3&lt;br/&gt;电影/Apple\"]\n    C --&gt; C2[\"Adobe RGB&lt;br/&gt;印刷\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"Rec.2020&lt;br/&gt;HDR广播\"]\n    D --&gt; D2[\"ProPhoto RGB&lt;br/&gt;编辑空间\"]\n    D --&gt; D3[\"ACEScg&lt;br/&gt;VFX\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>色彩空间与色域的关系，可以归纳为四个核心命题：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>色彩空间 = 色彩模型的具体实现</strong>：它由三原色的精确光谱位置、白点坐标和传输函数共同定义，缺一不可。</li>\n<li><strong>色域是能力边界</strong>：一个色彩空间能表示的颜色范围，本质上是其在 CIE 色度图上的三角形面积。</li>\n<li><strong>存在客观的包含关系</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>sRGB</mtext><mo>⊂</mo><mtext>DCI-P3</mtext><mo>⊂</mo><mtext>Rec.2020</mtext><mo>⊂</mo><mtext>ProPhoto RGB</mtext><mo>⊂</mo><mtext>CIE XYZ</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{sRGB} \\subset \\text{DCI-P3} \\subset \\text{Rec.2020} \\subset \\text{ProPhoto RGB} \\subset \\text{CIE XYZ}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sRGB</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊂</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DCI-P3</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊂</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Rec.2020</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊂</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ProPhoto RGB</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊂</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CIE XYZ</span></span></span></span></span></span>，宽色域空间可以无损包含窄色域空间。</li>\n<li><strong>选择是权衡而非越大越好</strong>：在&quot;信息容量&quot;与&quot;设备兼容性&quot;之间取舍——编辑时用宽空间保留信息，输出时转换到目标设备的最优空间。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"srgb-互联网的通用语言\">sRGB：互联网的通用语言</h2><h3 id=\"规格定义\">规格定义</h3><p>sRGB 由 HP 和 Microsoft 于 1996 年联合制定，是当今使用最广泛的色彩空间：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>sRGB Primaries (CIE xy)</mtext><mo>:</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.64</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0.33</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.30</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0.60</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.15</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0.06</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{sRGB Primaries (CIE xy)}: R(0.64, 0.33), G(0.30, 0.60), B(0.15, 0.06)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sRGB Primaries (CIE xy)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0.64</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.33</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0.30</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.60</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0.15</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.06</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>白点</td>\n<td>D65 (6500K)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gamma</td>\n<td>分段：线性段 + <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 2.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.2</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>色域覆盖</td>\n<td>CIE 1931 的 ~35%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位深标准</td>\n<td>8-bit (256级/通道)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"srgb-的局限\">sRGB 的局限</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缺失区域</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高饱和青色</td>\n<td>热带海水颜色无法准确表示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>深绿</td>\n<td>浓密植被色彩被压缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>紫色范围</td>\n<td>薰衣草/紫罗兰被截断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高饱和红</td>\n<td>某些花卉超出</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"dci-p3-新一代显示标准\">DCI-P3：新一代显示标准</h2><h3 id=\"从电影到消费设备\">从电影到消费设备</h3><p>DCI-P3 最初为数字电影放映设计（Digital Cinema Initiatives），2015 年后被 Apple 率先引入消费显示器（iMac 5K），如今已成为旗舰手机和显示器的标配色域。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>P3 色域</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.25</mn><mo>×</mo><mtext>sRGB 色域面积</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{P3 色域} \\approx 1.25 \\times \\text{sRGB 色域面积}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">P3 </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">色域</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.25</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sRGB </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">色域面积</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>DCI-P3 变体</th>\n<th>白点</th>\n<th>Gamma</th>\n<th>应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DCI-P3 (Theater)</td>\n<td>D50 (偏暖)</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.6</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>电影院放映</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Display P3 (Apple)</td>\n<td>D65</td>\n<td>sRGB 分段</td>\n<td>Apple 设备</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P3-D65</td>\n<td>D65</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.6</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>通用标准</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"2025-2026-p3-生态现状\">2025-2026 P3 生态现状</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设备类别</th>\n<th>P3 覆盖率（典型）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>iPhone 15/16 Pro</td>\n<td>100% P3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MacBook Pro (M3/M4)</td>\n<td>100% P3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>iPad Pro (M2/M4)</td>\n<td>100% P3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高端安卓旗舰</td>\n<td>95-100% P3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>专业显示器</td>\n<td>98-100% P3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>普通办公显示器</td>\n<td>85-95% sRGB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"adobe-rgb-印刷工作流\">Adobe RGB：印刷工作流</h2><h3 id=\"色域特性\">色域特性</h3><p>Adobe RGB 由 Adobe Systems 于 1998 年定义，针对 CMYK 印刷色域设计——它在绿色和青色方向扩展了 sRGB 的覆盖：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>sRGB</th>\n<th>Adobe RGB</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>绿色原色 CIE x</td>\n<td>0.30</td>\n<td>0.21</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>色域面积 (CIE)</td>\n<td>~35%</td>\n<td>~50%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CMYK 覆盖</td>\n<td>不完全</td>\n<td>几乎完全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用输出</td>\n<td>屏幕</td>\n<td>屏幕+印刷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络兼容</td>\n<td>直接兼容</td>\n<td>需转换</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"何时使用-adobe-rgb\">何时使用 Adobe RGB</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>条件</th>\n<th>推荐</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最终仅在屏幕显示</td>\n<td>sRGB 或 P3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要高质量印刷</td>\n<td>Adobe RGB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工作流含印刷预检</td>\n<td>Adobe RGB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后期空间需求</td>\n<td>ProPhoto RGB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"rec-2020-与-hdr\">Rec.2020 与 HDR</h2><h3 id=\"超宽色域标准\">超宽色域标准</h3><p>Rec.2020（BT.2020）是为 4K/8K 超高清广播制定的色彩标准，色域覆盖远超 P3：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Rec.2020 覆盖</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mn>75.8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mtext> CIE 1931</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Rec.2020 覆盖} \\approx 75.8\\% \\text{ CIE 1931}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Rec.2020 </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">覆盖</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">75.8%</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> CIE 1931</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>Rec.2020</th>\n<th>DCI-P3</th>\n<th>sRGB</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>色域面积 (CIE %)</td>\n<td>75.8%</td>\n<td>53.6%</td>\n<td>35.9%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>红色原色 (nm)</td>\n<td>630</td>\n<td>615.7</td>\n<td>614.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绿色原色 (nm)</td>\n<td>532</td>\n<td>545.6</td>\n<td>549.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蓝色原色 (nm)</td>\n<td>467</td>\n<td>465.3</td>\n<td>464.2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位深</td>\n<td>10/12-bit</td>\n<td>10-bit</td>\n<td>8-bit</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"当前设备覆盖现实\">当前设备覆盖现实</h3><p>截至 2026 年，没有消费级显示器能 100% 覆盖 Rec.2020——它是一个&quot;目标&quot;标准：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设备</th>\n<th>Rec.2020 覆盖率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>OLED 旗舰电视 (2025)</td>\n<td>~80%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mini-LED 高端 (2026)</td>\n<td>~85%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>量子点 OLED</td>\n<td>~90%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>激光投影</td>\n<td>~92%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Micro-LED (原型)</td>\n<td>~95%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"色域可视化\">色域可视化</h2><h3 id=\"cie-1931-色度图\">CIE 1931 色度图</h3><p>所有色彩空间都可以在 CIE 1931 xy 色度图上可视化为三角形：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;CIE 1931 Chromaticity&lt;br/&gt;色度图&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Horseshoe Boundary&lt;br/&gt;马蹄形边界 = 光谱轨迹&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;Triangles&lt;br/&gt;三角形 = 色彩空间色域&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;White Point&lt;br/&gt;白点位置&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;单色光 380-780nm&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;sRGB: 小三角&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[&quot;P3: 中三角&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[&quot;Rec.2020: 大三角&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;D65: 日光白&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[&quot;D50: 印刷白&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"CIE 1931 Chromaticity&lt;br/&gt;色度图\"] --&gt; B[\"Horseshoe Boundary&lt;br/&gt;马蹄形边界 = 光谱轨迹\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"Triangles&lt;br/&gt;三角形 = 色彩空间色域\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"White Point&lt;br/&gt;白点位置\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"单色光 380-780nm\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"sRGB: 小三角\"]\n    C --&gt; C2[\"P3: 中三角\"]\n    C --&gt; C3[\"Rec.2020: 大三角\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"D65: 日光白\"]\n    D --&gt; D2[\"D50: 印刷白\"]</pre><h3 id=\"色域包含关系\">色域包含关系</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>sRGB</mtext><mo>⊂</mo><mtext>DCI-P3</mtext><mo>⊂</mo><mtext>Rec.2020</mtext><mo>⊂</mo><mtext>ProPhoto RGB</mtext><mo>⊂</mo><mtext>CIE XYZ</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{sRGB} \\subset \\text{DCI-P3} \\subset \\text{Rec.2020} \\subset \\text{ProPhoto RGB} \\subset \\text{CIE XYZ}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sRGB</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊂</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DCI-P3</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊂</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Rec.2020</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊂</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ProPhoto RGB</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊂</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CIE XYZ</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>包含关系</th>\n<th>意味着</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>sRGB ⊂ P3</td>\n<td>P3 设备能准确显示所有 sRGB 颜色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P3 ⊂ Rec.2020</td>\n<td>Rec.2020 内容可无损包含 P3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ProPhoto ⊃ 可见色</td>\n<td>包含不可见色（虚拟原色）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"摄影工作流中的色彩空间选择\">摄影工作流中的色彩空间选择</h2><h3 id=\"决策矩阵\">决策矩阵</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工作阶段</th>\n<th>推荐空间</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>拍摄（相机设置）</td>\n<td>Adobe RGB 或 RAW 无关</td>\n<td>最大记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RAW 编辑</td>\n<td>ProPhoto RGB</td>\n<td>最大编辑余量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>精细调色</td>\n<td>ACEScg 或 线性 P3</td>\n<td>物理正确的混合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络输出</td>\n<td>sRGB</td>\n<td>最大兼容性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Apple 设备优化</td>\n<td>Display P3</td>\n<td>利用宽色域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HDR 视频输出</td>\n<td>Rec.2020 + PQ</td>\n<td>HDR 标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>印刷输出</td>\n<td>Adobe RGB → CMYK</td>\n<td>覆盖打印色域</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>色彩空间的选择不是&quot;越大越好&quot;的简单逻辑——它取决于工作流的每个环节和最终输出目标。核心原则是：<strong>编辑时用最宽空间保留信息，输出时转换到目标设备的最优空间</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>色彩空间</th>\n<th>色域大小</th>\n<th>核心场景</th>\n<th>关键注意</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>sRGB</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>网络/通用</td>\n<td>默认安全选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Display P3</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>Apple 生态</td>\n<td>需标记 profile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adobe RGB</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>印刷</td>\n<td>网络需转 sRGB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rec.2020</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>HDR 视频</td>\n<td>设备覆盖未达标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ProPhoto RGB</td>\n<td>极大</td>\n<td>编辑空间</td>\n<td>永不直接显示</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"色彩空间与色域","id":"色彩空间与色域"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"sRGB：互联网的通用语言","id":"srgb-互联网的通用语言"},{"level":3,"text":"规格定义","id":"规格定义"},{"level":3,"text":"sRGB 的局限","id":"srgb-的局限"},{"level":2,"text":"DCI-P3：新一代显示标准","id":"dci-p3-新一代显示标准"},{"level":3,"text":"从电影到消费设备","id":"从电影到消费设备"},{"level":3,"text":"2025-2026 P3 生态现状","id":"2025-2026-p3-生态现状"},{"level":2,"text":"Adobe RGB：印刷工作流","id":"adobe-rgb-印刷工作流"},{"level":3,"text":"色域特性","id":"色域特性"},{"level":3,"text":"何时使用 Adobe RGB","id":"何时使用-adobe-rgb"},{"level":2,"text":"Rec.2020 与 HDR","id":"rec-2020-与-hdr"},{"level":3,"text":"超宽色域标准","id":"超宽色域标准"},{"level":3,"text":"当前设备覆盖现实","id":"当前设备覆盖现实"},{"level":2,"text":"色域可视化","id":"色域可视化"},{"level":3,"text":"CIE 1931 色度图","id":"cie-1931-色度图"},{"level":3,"text":"色域包含关系","id":"色域包含关系"},{"level":2,"text":"摄影工作流中的色彩空间选择","id":"摄影工作流中的色彩空间选择"},{"level":3,"text":"决策矩阵","id":"决策矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"数字成像色彩流水线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-science/color-theory/digital-color-pipeline"},"next":{"title":"ICC 配置文件与色彩管理系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-science/color-management/icc-profiles"}}